#, no-wrap
msgid "Now let's run a VQE with an initial point made of all ones, with a maximum of 20 steps, and compare the convergence of both runs.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin na natin ang isang VQE na may initial point na binubuo ng lahat ng isa, na may maximum na 20 hakbang, at ikumpara ang convergence ng parehong run.\n"

